# Systems Thinking (and Systems Doing).

**Authors:** Brethower, Dale M., Dams, Peter-Cornelius

## Abstract
Introduces human performance technology (HPT) by answering the following questions related to: what systems does; practical issues and questions to which systems thinking is relevant; research questions and answers with respect to systems thinking; how HPT practitioners can do systems thinking; systems thinking tools; what is and is not known about systems thinking; a possible research agenda for scientist practitioners? (AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ597520

